The wintun.dll binaries in this directory are unmodified copies of the
WireGuard LLC Wintun driver userspace library
(https://www.wintun.net/), distributed under the Apache License 2.0
(see LICENSE in this directory), embedded here per architecture so the
library needs no external file deployment. The bindings the device
layer loads through are tun-rs's; this directory is only the driver
library itself.
